  "_comment": "Curated approximate MONTHLY on-demand cost (USD, us-east-1, ~730h/mo) per resource, for the cost-impact rule. Deliberately coarse: this is an early-warning heuristic to flag 'this PR meaningfully raises the bill', NOT a billing-accurate quote. Each resource type has an optional flat monthly base cost, and optionally a `by_attribute` map keyed on one pricing-driving attribute (e.g. instance_type). When the plan's value isn't in the map, `default` is used. Values are intentionally easy to extend region-by-region / type-by-type later, same as the other data files.",

